INSERT INTO `slotTrackerApp_rawmessages` VALUES ('2021-05-01 21:01:30_265','Added another channel for Bengaluru BBMP. Hope it helps all you folks too:\n\nhttps://t.me/joinchat/BOBlTTPtGYljZmI9','2021-05-01 15:31:30.000000',265),('2021-05-01 23:35:05_294','Vaccination centers for 18-45 group: \n1. Shanthinagar UPHC BLOCK 1 (East) - Pin: 560027.\n1 slots are available on May 02','2021-05-01 18:05:05.000000',294),('2021-05-02 17:46:05_294','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. MANIPAL NORTHSIDE (West) - Pin: 560003.\n2 slots are available on May 03','2021-05-02 12:16:05.000000',294),('2021-05-02 18:26:05_294','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. APOLLO HOSPITAL SHESHADRIPURAM (West) - Pin: 560020.\n95 slots are available on May 03','2021-05-02 12:56:05.000000',294),('2021-05-02 19:34:07_294','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. Manipal Hospital Covaxin (East) - Pin: 560017. Vaccine: COVAXIN. \n66 slots are available on May 03','2021-05-02 14:04:07.000000',294),('2021-05-02 21:24:20_294','I have increased the frequency at which the script checks your district to every minute. I understand that the slots are getting filled way too fast for you guys to go and book. Hence I am increasing the frequency. \nIf you have any better ideas/ suggestions, feel free to reach me at @BertyThomas (Twitter)','2021-05-02 15:54:20.000000',294),('2021-05-02 22:45:01_294','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. Manipal Hospital Covaxin (East) - Pin: 560017. Vaccine: COVAXIN. \n90 slots are available on May 03','2021-05-02 17:15:01.000000',294),('2021-05-02 22:50:04_294','I think that got booked in like maybe 2 min tops :(','2021-05-02 17:20:04.000000',294),('2021-05-03 11:47:02_294','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. APOLLO MEDICAL CENTER P3 (Mahadevapura) - Pin: 560066. Vaccine: COVISHIELD. \n59 slots are available on May 04','2021-05-03 06:17:02.000000',294),('2021-05-03 12:01:01_294','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. APOLLO MEDICAL CENTER P3 (Mahadevapura) - Pin: 560066. Vaccine: COVISHIELD. \n195 slots are available on May 05','2021-05-03 06:31:01.000000',294),('2021-05-03 14:08:04_294','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. Sahakarnagar UPHC 1 (Yelahanka) - Pin: 560097. Vaccine: . \n45 slots are available on May 04','2021-05-03 08:38:04.000000',294),('2021-05-03 14:34:03_294','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. APOLLO HOSPITAL 1 (Bommanahalli) - Pin: 560076. Vaccine: COVISHIELD. \n247 slots are available on May 04\n299 slots are available on May 05\n300 slots are available on May 06\n300 slots are available on May 07\n299 slots are available on May 08','2021-05-03 09:04:03.000000',294),('2021-05-03 17:04:06_294','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. APOLLO MEDICAL CENTER P3 (Mahadevapura) - Pin: 560066. Vaccine: COVISHIELD. \n75 slots are available on May 05','2021-05-03 11:34:06.000000',294),('2021-05-03 17:42:04_294','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. Manipal Clinic (South) - Pin: 560078. Vaccine: COVAXIN. \n66 slots are available on May 04','2021-05-03 12:12:04.000000',294),('2021-05-03 20:34:49_294','Guys, some of you mentioned that you donât see the slots on CoWin even though you acted immediately on the alert. I can understand the frustration. Right now, there is a huge supply-demand mismatch, especially for Bengaluru and Mumbai. Consider this, there are over 6000 people just here in this group fighting for 66 slots. You know how that will end.\nSome of you have been successful (especially around that 2:34pm alert) when 1500 slots were opened and reached out to me to tell about it over Twitter. In case anyone has found any trick/ suggestion on how we can book the slot on CoWin faster or anything else, please let me know and I can share it in this group.\nFrom my side, I would want to try and help too. Yesterday I made the script run checks every minute. Tomorrow onwards I am planning to run it every 10sec, around that 10:30am-6:30pm mark when slots seem to be getting added to CoWin. I am not saying that will solve all the issues. But should give you a better chance.\nStay safe!\n@BertyThomas (Twitter)','2021-05-03 15:04:49.000000',294),('2021-05-03 20:37:02_294','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. APOLLO HOSPITAL SHESHADRIPURAM (West) - Pin: 560020. Vaccine: COVISHIELD. \n172 slots are available on May 04\n\nCoWin: https://selfregistration.cowin.gov.in','2021-05-03 15:07:02.000000',294),('2021-05-03 20:43:03_294','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. Apollo Cradle P3 (Mahadevapura) - Pin: 560037. Vaccine: COVISHIELD. \n100 slots are available on May 04\n\nCoWin: https://selfregistration.cowin.gov.in','2021-05-03 15:13:03.000000',294),('2021-05-03 22:01:02_294','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. MANIPAL NORTHSIDE (West) - Pin: 560003. Vaccine: COVAXIN. \n33 slots are available on May 04\n\nCoWin: https://selfregistration.cowin.gov.in','2021-05-03 16:31:02.000000',294),('2021-05-04 13:46:04_265','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. COMMAND HOSPITAL AIR FORCE (Bengaluru North) - Pin: 560007. Vaccine: COVISHIELD. \n38 slots are available on May 04\n\nCoWin: https://selfregistration.cowin.gov.in','2021-05-04 08:16:04.000000',265),('2021-05-04 13:50:05_265','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. COMMAND HOSPITAL AIR FORCE (Bengaluru North) - Pin: 560007. Vaccine: COVISHIELD. \n48 slots are available on May 04\n\nCoWin: https://selfregistration.cowin.gov.in','2021-05-04 08:20:05.000000',265),('2021-05-04 13:58:28_294','Hi guys, surprisingly no alert was issued till now today. There was one guy who mentioned over twitter that there was some slot opened around 10-11 in the morning, but wasnt sure of the number of slots. The script doesnt alert if the slots are less than 10 (its pointless to do that).\nAnyways, based on previous couple of days, Apollo seem to add slots betweem 2-3pm. So lets see if that happens today as well.\nStay safe!','2021-05-04 08:28:28.000000',294),('2021-05-04 14:51:32_294','Vaccination centers 