 another programmer, based out of Bangalore, who is doing the same process, which is updating faster than what we had, but that was over Twitter (https://twitter.com/BloreVaccine). We share a common goal of helping people get access to vaccines even when they are not very comfortable with technology and hence decided to team up instead of doing the same thing separately. From now on, the updates will come from him on this Channel. For any queries, please reach out to him (https://twitter.com/BloreVaccine). For now he will be known only by this handle (even I do not know his name!). When the time is right, he will reveal his identity and make sure that you thank him for his service. \nI am planning to use my resources to reach out to smaller districts that have been requesting similar alert mechanisms. \nIt has been a pleasure serving you.\nGod bless & stay safe!','2021-05-06 10:45:40.000000',294),('2021-05-06 16:20:44_294','Hi everyone!','2021-05-06 10:50:44.000000',294),('2021-05-06 16:20:57_446','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. Central Hosp E Co Rly Age18-44 (Bhubaneswar MC) - Pin: 751023. Vaccine: COVAXIN. \n17 slots are available on May 10\n\nCoWin: https://selfregistration.cowin.gov.in','2021-05-06 10:50:57.000000',446),('2021-05-06 16:24:49_446','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. Central Hosp E Co Rly Age18-44 (Bhubaneswar MC) - Pin: 751023. Vaccine: COVAXIN. \n200 slots are available on May 11\n\nCoWin: https://selfregistration.cowin.gov.in','2021-05-06 10:54:49.000000',446),('2021-05-06 16:36:46_446','Vaccination centers for 18-44 group: \n1. Central Hosp E Co Rly Age18-44 (Bhubaneswar MC) - Pin: 751023. Vaccine: COVAXIN. \n28 slots are available on May 12\n\nCoWin: https://selfregistration.cowin.gov.in','2021-05-06 11:06:46.000000',446),('2021-05-06 16:53:36_294','Sorry, just to be clear. The alerts are going to be available BOTH over this Telegram channel AND the mentioned Twitter account simultaneously. ð','2021-05-06 11:23:36.000000'